{"displayStem":"표지 후 비표지 아미노산으로 바꾼 세포의 pulse-chase 실험이다. 재이용은 억제되었고 각 곡선은 합성 기대값이다. 총 표적 단백질량은 모든 조건에서 유지되었다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육 목적으로 구성한 학습자료입니다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C02 c02-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c02-vector\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 520 350\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"교육용 자료 18\" style=\"font-family:Arial,'Noto Sans CJK KR',sans-serif\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"350\" fill=\"white\"></rect><text x=\"78\" y=\"24\" font-size=\"18\" text-anchor=\"start\">표지 잔존량 (%)</text><path d=\"M78,60 L78,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78,270 L483,270\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><path d=\"M78.0,270 L78.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"78.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><path d=\"M213.0,270 L213.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"213.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><path d=\"M348.0,270 L348.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"348.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><path d=\"M483.0,270 L483.0,276\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"483.0\" y=\"298\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\">12</text><path d=\"M72,270.0 L78,270.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"275.0\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><path d=\"M72,218.75 L78,218.75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"223.75\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">25</text><path d=\"M72,167.5 L78,167.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"></path><text x=\"66\" y=\"172.5\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"end\">50</text><path d=\"M72,116.25 L78,116.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"